WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.958 --> 00:00:04.550
- Here's a quick tip from someone we love.

00:00:04.550 --> 00:00:05.900
- Hi, Drew, I'm Eugene.

00:00:05.900 --> 00:00:07.890
You might know me as the Euge Food.

00:00:07.890 --> 00:00:10.824
I'm gonna show you the
best way to reheat pizza.

00:00:10.824 --> 00:00:12.160
(cackling)

00:00:12.160 --> 00:00:14.070
Get a pan, non-stick, doesn't matter.

00:00:14.070 --> 00:00:16.670
You're gonna put your
pizza into the pan cold.

00:00:16.670 --> 00:00:18.859
We want this to come up to heat slowly.

00:00:18.859 --> 00:00:21.510
Cover it with a lid, tin foil works too.

00:00:21.510 --> 00:00:22.440
Let's be serious.

00:00:22.440 --> 00:00:24.823
Are you just really gonna have one slice?

00:00:24.823 --> 00:00:25.790
(cackling)

00:00:25.790 --> 00:00:27.690
You're gonna get a tray, parchment paper,

00:00:27.690 --> 00:00:29.050
pizza slices down like this.

00:00:29.050 --> 00:00:30.630
Cover with tin foil.

00:00:30.630 --> 00:00:32.480
Your oven rack to to the lowest rack.

00:00:32.480 --> 00:00:33.953
Oven at 275.

00:00:36.831 --> 00:00:37.900
(Eugene exclaiming)

00:00:37.900 --> 00:00:39.473
One of the oven slices.

00:00:40.460 --> 00:00:41.945
Oh, listen.

00:00:41.945 --> 00:00:44.052
(pizza crunching)

00:00:44.052 --> 00:00:47.244
Mm, oh, so good.

00:00:47.244 --> 00:00:48.785
- I live for tips.

00:00:48.785 --> 00:00:51.535
(cheerful music)

